  "description": "Region geofencing endpoints for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge web app, backed by Shiny.Geofencing.Regions — GPS-driven monitoring of an unlimited number of polygon, proximity and reverse-geocoded regions, the regions the device is in, and enter/exit changes delivered to the page as events and handler calls. One call: bridge.AddRegionGeofenceBridge(cfg => cfg.AddRegionSet(…)).",
